Usage: nexo remote <subcommand>
List and operate on containers on remote machines.

Subcommands:
  close        Close a local proxy container.
  list         List containers on configured remote machines.
  new          Create a remote container and open its proxy.
  open         Open a remote container locally or through a proxy.
  passthrough  Forward keys to a remote container.
  paste        Upload an image from the clipboard, or pass keys through.
  previous     Open the previous remote container.

Examples:
  nexo remote list
  nexo remote open devbox/api
  nexo remote new devbox feature-api

Run 'nexo remote <subcommand> --help' for more.
